{"path":"contact.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <title>Contact — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Connect with {{BUSINESS_NAME}} — integrative consultations, practical session planning, and a clear contact route.">
  <style>
    :root{
      --bg:#f6efe6; /* warm cream */
      --accent:#7a5a37; /* deep terracotta */
      --muted:#a99784; /* sand */
      --accent-2:#557a5a; /* muted green */
      --card:#fffaf6;
      --glass:rgba(255,255,255,0.6);
      --radius:12px;
      --max-width:980px;
      font-family:Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial;
      color:var(--accent);
    }
    html,body{height:100%;background:var(--bg);margin:0}
    body{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;padding:28px 20px 80px}
    .site{width:100%;max-width:var(--max-width);}
    header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;margin-bottom:18px}
    .brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px}
    .mark{width:46px;height:46px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent-2),var(--accent));display:grid;place-items:center;color:#fff;font-weight:700}
    .title{font-size:15px;line-height:1;margin:0}
    .tag{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);margin:0}
    nav{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap}
    nav a{font-size:13px;color:var(--accent);text-decoration:none;padding:8px 10px;border-radius:8px}
    nav a[href$="contact.html"]{background:var(--glass);backdrop-filter: blur(4px)}

    main{background:transparent}
    .hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:18px;padding:20px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.6),rgba(255,255,255,0.3));border-radius:var(--radius);box-shadow:0 6px 20px rgba(120,90,60,0.06);margin-bottom:18px}
    .hero h1{margin:0;font-size:22px}
    .hero p{margin:6px 0 0;color:var(--muted)}

    .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:18px}
    @media(min-width:880px){.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 360px}}

    .card{background:var(--card);border-radius:12px;padding:18px;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(110,70,40,0.06)}
    .muted{color:var(--muted);font-size:14px}
    .contact-list{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;margin-top:8px}
    .contact-item{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center}
    .btn{background:var(--accent);color:white;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;border:none;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer}
    .secondary{background:transparent;border:1px solid var(--muted);color:var(--accent);padding:8px 12px;border-radius:10px}

    form .row{display:flex;flex-direction:column;margin-bottom:10px}
    input,textarea,select{padding:10px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #e4d9cf;font-size:14px}
    textarea{min-height:110px;resize:vertical}

    .planner h3{margin:0 0 6px 0}
    .plan-output{white-space:pre-wrap;background:#fff7f2;border-radius:8px;padding:12px;border:1px dashed rgba(122,90,55,0.12);font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;color:#5b3f2a}
    .planner-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:8px}
    @media(min-width:680px){.planner-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}}

    .faq{display:grid;gap:10px}
    .faq-item{padding:12px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid rgba(86,64,48,0.06)}

    .cta-row{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;margin-top:10px}

    /* reveal animation */
    .reveal{opacity:0;transform:translateY(18px);transition:opacity 520ms cubic-bezier(.2,.9,.2,1),transform 520ms cubic-bezier(.2,.9,.2,1)}
    .reveal.visible{opacity:1;transform:none}
    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){
      .reveal{transition:none;opacity:1;transform:none}
    }

    footer{margin-top:28px;text-align:center;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}

    /* pattern background */
    .pattern-wrap{background-image:url('assets/img/pattern.svg');background-repeat:repeat;padding:14px;border-radius:14px}

    .copy-btn{background:var(--accent-2);color:white;border:none;padding:8px 10px;border-radius:8px;cursor:pointer}
    .small{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="site">
    <header>
      <div class="brand">
        <div class="mark">HM</div>
        <div>
          <p class="title">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</p>
          <p class="tag">{{TAGLINE}}</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <nav aria-label="Primary navigation">
        <a href="index.html">Welcome</a>
        <a href="services.html">Offerings</a>
        <a href="conditions.html">Questions</a>
        <a href="approach.html">Method</a>
        <a href="pricing.html">Rates</a>
        <a href="about.html">Team</a>
        <a href="book.html">Book</a>
        <a href="contact.html" aria-current="page">Connect</a>
      </nav>
    </header>

    <main>
      <section class="hero reveal" id="hero">
        <h1>Connect with a pragmatic, integrative guide</h1>
        <p>Reach out to arrange an initial conversation or to ask a quick question. Use the Session Planner below to sketch a clear path before you book.</p>
      </section>

      <div class="grid">
        <aside class="card reveal" id="contact-card">
          <h2 style="margin-top:0">Contact</h2>
          <p class="muted">Prefer to connect directly? Phone or email are fastest for scheduling.</p>
          <div class="contact-list">
            <div class="contact-item"><strong>Phone:</strong>&nbsp;<a href="tel:{{PHONE}}">{{PHONE}}</a></div>
            <div class="contact-item"><strong>Email:</strong>&nbsp;<a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a></div>
            <div class="contact-item"><strong>Location:</strong>&nbsp;<span>{{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</span></div>
          </div>

          <div style="margin-top:12px">
            <a class="btn" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
            <a class="secondary" href="book.html">Schedule a consult</a>
          </div>

          <div class="pattern-wrap" style="margin-top:12px">
            <p class="small">You can also message with a short summary below. We review requests during business hours and respond within 48 hours.</p>
          </div>
        </aside>

        <section class="card reveal" id="planner">
          <div class="planner">
            <h2 style="margin-top:0">Session Planner — build a succinct plan</h2>
            <p class="muted">Draft a personalized approach you can bring to a first session. This creates a compact summary you can copy or save.</p>

            <div class="planner-grid" style="margin-top:12px">
              <div>
                <label for="concern">Primary focus or concern</label>
                <input id="concern" placeholder="e.g., sleep fragmentation, low energy, digestive shifts">
              </div>
              <div>
                <label for="format">Preferred format</label>
                <select id="format">
                  <option>Hybrid (initial virtual)</option>
                  <option>Virtual only</option>
                  <option>In-person</option>
                </select>
              </div>
              <div>
                <label for="time">Time you can commit weekly</label>
                <select id="time">
                  <option>1–2 hours</option>
                  <option>3–5 hours</option>
                  <option>6+ hours</option>
                </select>
              </div>
              <div>
                <label for="cadence">Desired contact cadence</label>
                <select id="cadence">
                  <option>Single focused session (VIP-style)</option>
                  <option>Short series (4–6 weeks)</option>
                  <option>Ongoing monthly support</option>
                </select>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div style="margin-top:8px">
              <label for="goals">Top goals (comma separated)</label>
              <input id="goals" placeholder="e.g., regular sleep, steady energy, fewer GI flares">
            </div>

            <div style="margin-top:8px">
              <label for="notes">Additional context (optional)</label>
              <textarea id="notes" placeholder="Any constraints, preferences, previous approaches tried"></textarea>
            </div>

            <div class="cta-row" style="margin-top:12px">
              <button class="btn" id="build">Build Plan</button>
              <button class="secondary" id="clear">Clear</button>
              <button class="copy-btn" id="copy" aria-label="Copy plan">Copy</button>
              <button class="secondary" id="download">Download</button>
            </div>

            <div style="margin-top:12px">
              <div class="plan-output" id="output" aria-live="polite">Your plan summary will appear here.</div>
            </div>

            <p class="small" style="margin-top:8px">This summary is for planning and conversation. It does not replace personalized medical advice.</p>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="card reveal" id="message-form" style="grid-column:1/-1">
          <h2 style="margin-top:0">Send a quick message</h2>
          <form id="contactForm" action="mailto:{{EMAIL}}" method="post" enctype="text/plain">
            <div class="row">
              <label for="name">Your name</label>
              <input id="name" name="Name" required>
            </div>
            <div class="row">
              <label for="email">Email</label>
              <input id="email" name="Email" type="email" required>
            </div>
            <div class="row">
              <label for="message">Message</label>
              <textarea id="message" name="Message" placeholder="Briefly describe what you hope to address"></textarea>
            </div>
            <div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center">
              <button type="submit" class="btn">Send message</button>
              <button type="button" id="prefill" class="secondary">Prefill with planner</button>
              <div class="small" style="margin-left:auto">We do not sell contact details.</div>
            </div>
          </form>
        </section>

        <section class="card faq reveal" id="faq" style="grid-column:1/-1">
          <h3 style="margin:0">FAQs</h3>
          <div class="faq-item">
            <strong>How quickly can I book?</strong>
            <div class="muted">Typical wait is 1–3 weeks for new clients. If you select a VIP single session, we prioritize a sooner slot.</div>
          </div>
          <div class="faq-item">
            <strong>Do you accept insurance?</strong>
            <div class="muted">We are primarily a private-pay practice; receipts and codes are provided on request for out-of-network reimbursement where applicable.</div>
          </div>
        </section>
      </div>

    </main>

    <footer class="reveal" id="footer">
      <div>© <span id="year"></span> {{BUSINESS_NAME}} — Practical integrative guidance in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>
    </footer>
  </div>

  <script>
    // Small utility: escape for text download
    function downloadText(filename, text){
      const blob = new Blob([text], {type: 'text/plain'});
      const a = document.createElement('a');
      a.href = URL.createObjectURL(blob);
      a.download = filename;
      document.body.appendChild(a);
      a.click();
      a.remove();
      URL.revokeObjectURL(a.href);
    }

    // Session Planner logic
    (function(){
      const buildBtn = document.getElementById('build');
      const copyBtn = document.getElementById('copy');
      const downloadBtn = document.getElementById('download');
      const clearBtn = document.getElementById('clear');
      const output = document.getElementById('output');

      function gather(){
        return {
          concern: document.getElementById('concern').value.trim(),
          format: document.getElementById('format').value,
          time: document.getElementById('time').value,
          cadence: document.getElementById('cadence').value,
          goals: document.getElementById('goals').value.trim(),
          notes: document.getElementById('notes').value.trim(),
          generatedAt: new Date().toLocaleString()
        };
      }

      function synthesize(data){
        // Gentle, educational framing; no guarantees
        const lines = [];
        lines.push('Session Planner summary — ' + data.generatedAt);
        lines.push('Primary focus: ' + (data.concern || '[not specified]'));
        lines.push('Preferred format: ' + data.format);
        lines.push('Weekly time budget: ' + data.time);
        lines.push('Contact cadence preference: ' + data.cadence);
        if(data.goals) lines.push('Top stated goals: ' + data.goals);
        if(data.notes) lines.push('Context / constraints: ' + data.notes);

        // Simple reasoning engine for suggestions
        lines.push('\nSuggested approach:');
        if(/sleep|insomn|rest/i.test(data.concern)){
          lines.push('- Focused sleep hygiene + evening routine review in first session. Consider 2–3 short follow-ups over 4 weeks to adjust habits.');
        } else if(/digest|gut|stomach|bowel/i.test(data.concern)){
          lines.push('- Gather brief food & symptom log for 1–2 weeks. Initial consultation to prioritize testing and simple trials.');
        } else if(/energy|fatigue/i.test(data.concern)){
          lines.push('- Start with baseline activity & nutrition review, then a targeted 4-week plan of manageable adjustments.');
        } else {
          lines.push('- Begin with a focused intake to map priorities; we often set 2–3 achievable steps and reassess at 2–6 weeks.');
        }

        lines.push('\nHow this plan fits your inputs:');
        lines.push('- Format & cadence chosen: ' + data.format + ', ' + data.cadence + '.');
        lines.push('- Estimated commitment matches your weekly availability: ' + data.time + '.');

        lines.push('\nNext steps to bring to a first session:');
        lines.push('- Share this summary at first contact.');
        lines.push('- If you have any recent labs or notes, bring them or attach to your booking confirmation.');
        lines.push('\nNote: This is planning guidance for discussion, not a medical diagnosis or replacement for direct medical care.');

        return lines.join('\n');
      }

      buildBtn.addEventListener('click', function(){
        const data = gather();
        const text = synthesize(data);
        output.textContent = text;
      });

      copyBtn.addEventListener('click', async function(){
        try{
          const text = output.textContent || '';
          await navigator.clipboard.writeText(text);
          copyBtn.textContent = 'Copied';
          setTimeout(()=>copyBtn.textContent = 'Copy',1200);
        }catch(e){
          // fallback: select + exec
          const ta = document.createElement('textarea');
          ta.value = output.textContent || '';
          document.body.appendChild(ta);
          ta.select();
          document.execCommand('copy');
          ta.remove();
          copyBtn.textContent = 'Copied';
          setTimeout(()=>copyBtn.textContent = 'Copy',1200);
        }
      });

      downloadBtn.addEventListener('click', function(){
        const text = output.textContent || '';
        downloadText('session-plan.txt', text);
      });

      clearBtn.addEventListener('click', function(){
        ['concern','goals','notes'].forEach(id=>document.getElementById(id).value='');
        output.textContent = 'Your plan summary will appear here.';
      });

      // Prefill contact form from planner
      document.getElementById('prefill').addEventListener('click', function(){
        const data = gather();
        const summary = synthesize(data);
        const messageField = document.getElementById('message');
        messageField.value = summary;
        messageField.focus();
      });

    })();

    // Scroll reveal with prefers-reduced-motion support
    (function(){
      const prefersReduced = window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;
      const reveals = document.querySelectorAll('.reveal');
      if(prefersReduced){
        reveals.forEach(el=>el.classList.add('visible'));
        return;
      }

      const observer = new IntersectionObserver((entries)=>{
        entries.forEach(entry=>{
          if(entry.isIntersecting){
            entry.target.classList.add('visible');
            observer.unobserve(entry.target);
          }
        });
      },{threshold:0.12});

      reveals.forEach(el => observer.observe(el));
    })();

    // small nicety: current year
    document.getElementById('year').textContent = new Date().getFullYear();
  </script>
</body>
</html>"} 
{"path":"README.md","content":"Chunk 4 — contact.html and README for holistic_medicine-MORE-2026-02-17T19-54-36-202Z-025

Files included:
- contact.html : The contact/connect page with an interactive Session Planner widget, accessible contact form, and scroll-triggered reveal behavior.

Notes and highlights:
- Placeholders retained: {{BUSINESS_NAME}}, {{TAGLINE}}, {{PHONE}}, {{EMAIL}}, {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}, {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}, {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}.
- Navigation uses a distinct label set: Welcome, Offerings, Questions, Method, Rates, Team, Book, Connect.
- Visual theme: earthy / warm palette with inline CSS only; background pattern references assets/img/pattern.svg (ensure that asset exists in the project).
- Session Planner: local JS creates a plaintext summary based on form inputs; supports Build Plan, Copy to clipboard, Download as .txt, Clear, and Prefill the contact form with the generated plan.
- Scroll-reveal: implemented using IntersectionObserver and respects prefers-reduced-motion; sections with class "reveal" animate into view.
- Accessibility: aria-live for plan output, labels for inputs, and keyboard-friendly controls.

Testing instructions:
1. Place this contact.html into your build folder alongside the other pages (index.html, services.html, etc.).
2. Ensure assets/img/pattern.svg exists (unique SVG pattern created in another chunk) so the decorative background loads.
3. Open contact.html in a browser. Try the Session Planner: fill fields and click "Build Plan". Use Copy and Download to confirm behavior.
4. Test reduced-motion: enable prefers-reduced-motion in system settings and reload — reveal transitions should be disabled.

Developer notes:
- The planner provides educational suggestions only; copy contains a clear disclaimer.
- No external libraries or CDNs are used. All JS and CSS are inline and local.
- The mail form uses mailto action for simple deployments; swap for an API endpoint or JS submission as needed.

This chunk intentionally keeps language pragmatic and executive-sharp while avoiding previously used signature phrases and guarantees."}
